          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naku nĩwingĩvĩtye ĩ mbaĩ, nĩwongelete ũtanu wayo: nĩtanaa mbee waku o ta ũtanu wa ngethanĩ, o tondũ matanaa yĩla mekũaana mũtavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
